#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
msgid ""
"Actions address material workforce impacts such as labor conditions,\n"
"                                diversity,\n"
"                                inclusion, health &amp; safety, training, "
"and social dialogue.\n"
"                                Resources are\n"
"                                allocated to mitigate risks, enhance "
"positive impacts, and implement\n"
"                                workforce-related programs. Actions are "
"prioritized based on\n"
"                                severity and likelihood\n"
"                                of impacts, following a mitigation "
"hierarchy: prevent, reduce,\n"
"                                remediate, promote\n"
"                                positive opportunities. Engagement with "
"workers and representatives\n"
"                                informs the\n"
"                                planning and execution of actions."
msgstr ""
"Les actions traitent les impacts matériels liés au personnel, tels que les "
"conditions de travail,\n"
"                            la diversité,\n"
"                            l’inclusion, la santé &amp; sécurité, la "
"formation et le dialogue social.\n"
"                            Des ressources sont\n"
"                            allouées pour atténuer les risques, renforcer "
"les impacts positifs et mettre en œuvre\n"
"                            les programmes liés au personnel. Les actions "
"sont priorisées sur la base de\n"
"                            la gravité et de la probabilité\n"
"                            des impacts, selon une hiérarchie "
"d’atténuation : prévenir, réduire,\n"
"                            remédier, promouvoir\n"
"                            les opportunités positives. L’engagement avec "
"les travailleurs et leurs représentants\n"
"                            alimente la\n"
"                            planification et l’exécution des actions."

