"transversales,\n"
"                            et des investissements\n"
"                            en capital. Liez clairement les actions aux "
"politiques de pollution\n"
"                            correspondantes (E2-1)."

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:esg.action_view_esg_action
msgid ""
"Actions are the specific steps or measures that an organization takes to "
"implement its ESG strategy.\n"
"                They are the actionable items that help achieve its ESG "
"goals, including the targets set to track progress over time."
msgstr ""

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e3
msgid ""
"Actions focus on <strong>avoiding</strong>, <strong>reducing</strong>,\n"
"                                and <strong>\n"
"                                    restoring</strong> water and marine "
"impacts. Resources are\n"
"                                allocated through environmental budgets, "
"with performance monitored\n"
"                                via specific water-related KPIs."
msgstr ""
"Les actions se concentrent sur <strong>l’évitement</strong>, la "
"<strong>réduction</strong>,\n"
"                                et la <strong>\n"
"                                    restauration</strong> des impacts sur "
"l’eau et les ressources marines. Des ressources sont\n"
"                                allouées via les budgets environnementaux, "
"avec une performance suivie\n"
"                                par des KPI spécifiques liés à l’eau."

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e4
msgid ""
"Actions follow the mitigation hierarchy: avoidance, reduction,\n"
"                                restoration, and\n"
"                                offsetting. Local communities and indigenous "
"knowledge are\n"
"                                incorporated.\n"
"                                Biodiversity offsets are documented with "
"area, type, quality\n"
"                                criteria, and\n"
"                                standards."
msgstr ""
"Les actions suivent la hiérarchie d’atténuation : évitement, réduction,\n"
"                            restauration et\n"
"                            compensation. Les communautés locales et les "
"savoirs autochtones sont\n"
"                            intégrés.\n"
"                            Les compensations de biodiversité sont "
"documentées avec la surface, le type, les critères\n"
"                            de qualité et\n"
"                            les normes."

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_vsm_b7
msgid ""
"Actions implemented by {{ company_name }} to support its circular economy "
"approach and improve waste management:"
msgstr ""
"Actions mises en œuvre par {{ company_name }} pour soutenir son approche "
"d’économie circulaire et améliorer la gestion des déchets :"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s4
msgid ""
"Actions include\n"
"                                            product redesigns,\n"
"                                            privacy-compliance programs, "
"recall campaigns, and\n"
"                                            consumer education\n"
"                                            initiatives. Effectiveness is "
"measured by reductions in\n"
"                                            complaints,\n"
"                                            improved satisfaction, and "
"compliance with safety\n"
"                                            regulations."
msgstr ""
"Les actions incluent\n"
"                                        la refonte des produits,\n"
"                                        les programmes de conformité à la "
"confidentialité, les campagnes de rappel et\n"
"                                        les initiatives d’éducation\n"
"                                        des consommateurs. L’efficacité est "
"mesurée par la réduction des\n"
"                                        plaintes,\n"
"                                        l’amélioration de la satisfaction et "
"la conformité aux\n"
"                                        réglementations de sécurité."

