"violations de la confidentialité, sont\n"
"                    conservés afin d’identifier les tendances, les "
"améliorations de performance et les risques émergents."

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_governance_c
msgid ""
"At least three years of governance indicators; such as confirmed corruption/"
"bribery\n"
